            "review_title": "Review at Gusti Western Fusion Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tim\nSeoul, South Korea3 contributions\n0\nA Hidden Gem in Grand World! Fantastic Food & Amazing Service\nJul 2026 • Family\nMy family and I had an incredible dinner here! From the moment we walked in, the staff was amazingly attentive and welcoming. But the real star of the show was the food-this place is a true hidden gem in Grand World.\n\nThe pizza was expertly prepared with a genuine, authentic Western taste, and the pasta was outright delicious. You could really tell the sauce had the perfect balance of herbs and savory meat.\n\nHands down, a must-visit spot in Grand World!\nRead more\nWritten July 26, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
