            "review_text": "Сколково Т\n1 contribution\n0\nPoisoned herself in this place.\nJan 2026 • Family\nI got some seafood pasta for dinner yesterday. Judging by the tables and empty plates of the guests, I thought I could trust the reviews on trip advisor. When I ate, one of the shrimp didn't seem very fresh, the others were normal. Decided what it seemed. I didn't eat anything else after. As a result, in the middle of the night, there was a stomach wringer, in the morning, and after spitefully going to the amusement park, it got worse and worse. I ended up throwing up in the toilet, a couple of hours left.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten January 25, 2026",
